            "answer": "<p>Professional installation is not required for many Cozyology motorized products. Follow the installation instructions supplied with your selected track or shade.</p><p>If you would like help confirming compatibility or installation requirements before ordering, email <a href=\"mailto:design@cozyology.com\">design@cozyology.com</a>.</p>",
